{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"还说不清\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-1\",\n      \"text\": \"欢喜稍退，他又想知道对方是否也把他放在心上，自己的快乐终究说明不了对方的心意。\",\n      \"key\": \"放在心上\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-2\",\n      \"text\": \"想到自己刚才还以为不求回应就不会失去，他心里难堪，也怀疑自己对对方好时是不是暗暗盼着被珍惜。\",\n      \"key\": \"怀疑自己\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-3\",\n      \"text\": \"可他关心对方、享受亲近时确实很快乐，那时并没想着要换回什么。\",\n      \"key\": \"没想着要换回\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他也不敢认定亲近会一直如此，不急着替自己辩白或用热情盖住难堪，想把亲近留住的劲头便松了些。\",\n      \"key\": \"把亲近留住\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"失效\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"动摇\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R20\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S05-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留欢喜退去后仍想知道对方心意的愿望，写明自己的快乐不能替对方回答。用 S03-4 中已有的期待和 S04-5 中失效的保证解释不确定感，不把它写成突然反复。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R21\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S05-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留难堪和对体贴动机的怀疑，具体落到他是否暗暗盼着被珍惜，并接回先前以为不求回应就不会失去的想法。删去工整对照和未承认的期待这类概念化说法。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R22\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S05-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"保留并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留两件同时成立的事实：他仍想被珍惜，但先前关心对方、享受亲近时确实快乐，并非盘算交换。用具体的亲近经历保住这份快乐的真实性，不把矛盾简化成自欺。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R23\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S05-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留暂时不替自己辩白、不用新的热情遮住难堪的停顿，补出他不敢保证亲近会长久后，想留住亲近的劲头为何松下来，从而解释 B3 的释放感。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5c33c4cf-7f17-4558-95a4-7fc5be4a2589", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T112056969349Z", "elapsed_seconds": 887.968, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T11:35:44.956076+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3fbb5f5c7b909b7a42cceda5473513efecab63d96ca06fc049703fb82d025b7a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\p